      <h1 class="page__title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page__sub mono">LAST UPDATED: OCT 2026</p>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>Contact + shipping details when you order, your email if you subscribe, and basic analytics (pages viewed, device type). That's it.</p>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>To fulfill orders, send drop emails you asked for, and improve the site. We never sell your data — to anyone, ever.</p>
      <h2>Newsletter</h2>
      <p>One email per drop, maybe a rescue update. Unsubscribe link is in every email; it works instantly.</p>
      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use a small set of cookies — see the <a href="/pages/cookie-policy" style="text-decoration:underline">Cookie Policy</a> for the full list.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can request a copy or deletion of your data anytime via the <a href="/pages/contact" style="text-decoration:underline">contact page</a>. We respond within 30 days.</p>
      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>Order records are kept as long as tax law requires; marketing data until you unsubscribe.</p>
    </div>
